-- title:
--   Original positive compensated cash excess is dominated by canonical positive spatial error plus genuine ruin-contact cash
-- statement:
--   In the original standing BV infinite-activity spectrally negative Levy source with admissible singular dividend D, prescribed physical uniform grid, arbitrary cofinal bands and exact compensated negative-mark source N, define the canonical residual as true strict cash and full-horizon survivor terminal F minus w(x), N and true stopped ruin-contact cash. Prove each original positive cash excess is integrable and pointwise no greater than the canonical positive spatial residual plus genuine nonnegative Stieltjes contact. Uses Proved original BVA98 and no source substitutions, finite activity or generator L1, separating the remaining convergence-of-spatial-error obligation for BVA62/BVA96.

import Mathlib
import Theorems.Thm_AvramDividend_Classical_avram_bva98_original_BV_compensated_cash_positive_excess_each_row_integrable
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_SpectrallyNegativeLevy
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_DividendStrategy
